Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 12:43:55 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: End lists cleanly above the navigation bar

Theme.Settings turns off child clipping, so with the transparent
navigation bar the rows and glass cards of every list page drew past
the list, behind the navigation buttons and under the action bar, and
looked sliced off. Clip each list to its own bounds, and fade content
that continues past the top or bottom edge over 48dp. The homepage,
which lays out behind the navigation bar, now ends its scroll view
above it. The backdrop still runs behind the bars, and the end-of-list
gap is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: Id11d754d50e2047260cb0ab8d13021f1611cf7af
